  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fish for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme targets socio-economic development in Ghana through sustainable management of Ghana&#x2019;s marine fisheries resources and aquaculture production. The programme has been designed to prioritize activities that will enhance Ghana&apos;s Fisheries Commission&#x2019;s capacity for sustainable management of marine fisheries resources and aquaculture production. 

Institutional cooperation agreement between IMR and MoFAD.</narrative>
  </description>
